-- DarkChaos map 751 (Silverpine): the two wagons drive back along the road instead of straight across
-- Lordamere Lake.
--
-- Paths 447310 (Horde Hauler 4144731, guid 16716000) and 447640 (Horde Coffin Hauler 4144764, guid 16714703,
-- the same road reversed, see Custom/Custom feature SQLs/worlddb/Plaguelands/83_coffin_hauler_return.sql) are
-- one-way, 63 nodes each. With MovementType 2 a wagon goes from its last node back to node 1, and since
-- 84_hauler_crew_and_pathing.sql gave both wagons IGNORE_PATHFINDING (to keep them on the bridges) that leg is
-- a 1,792-yard straight line over the lake. No other path walker on maps 750/751 has a closing leg over 150
-- yards (302 checked, 2026-11-22).
--
-- Fix: nodes 64-124 repeat nodes 62-2 in reverse, so each wagon drives the road back, stopping at the same
-- three stops, and the closing leg 124 -> 1 is one ordinary road segment. The two wagons still start at
-- opposite ends of the road. Re-runnable.

-- path 447310: return leg, nodes 64-124 = nodes 62-2, 3 stops
DELETE FROM `waypoint_data` WHERE `id` = 447310 AND `point` > 63;

-- path 447640: return leg, nodes 64-124 = nodes 62-2, 3 stops
DELETE FROM `waypoint_data` WHERE `id` = 447640 AND `point` > 63;
